Gustav Larsson"] ", who had started 32nd. Larsson was followed by top pro racer " [:a {:href "/athletes/103648"} "Levi Leipheimer"] " (USA) but Leipheimer could only move into second place. Nobody bettered their times until Cancellara went on the course. Cancellara started slowly, and was placed only third at the first checkpoint. But he made his time on the downhill sections of the course, and came in just over 33 seconds ahead of Larsson. The 2008 World Champion, " [:a {:href "/athletes/111582"} "Bert Grabsch"] " (GER), placed 14th."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Bib"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {} "Margin"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103662"} "Fabian Cancellara"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SUI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SUI.png"}] "SUI"]] [:td {} "1-02:11.43"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103645"} "Gustav Larsson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "1-02:44.79"] [:td {} "at 33.36"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/103648"} "Levi Leipheimer"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "1-03:21.11"] [:td {} "at 1:09.68"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [